guide forever/class/priest/starshards-and-elunes-grace
title Starshards and Elune's Grace
category Class
class Priest
folder Priest
faction Alliance
race NightElf
levels 10-20
zone Darnassus
keywords Starshards, Stars of Elune, Returning Home, Elune's Grace, Priestess Alathea, Laurna Morninglight, Brother Joshua, Nara Meideros, Braenna Flintcrag, Temple of the Moon, Night Elf, racial, Priest
reward spell 10797 "Starshards"
reward spell 2651 "Elune's Grace"
why The Night Elf priest spells: Starshards at 10, Elune's Grace at 20. Free, no objectives.

# The Night Elf Priest spell quests. Each spell has one quest at the teacher,
# Priestess Alathea (upper balcony of the Temple of the Moon, beside Tyrande
# Whisperwind, Darnassus: npcs.json and a Darnassus trainer guide agree), and
# letters from priest trainers in other towns; any one teaches the spell and
# the game offers only one of a set:
#   Starshards (level 10):
#     5627 Stars of Elune, Priestess Alathea (Darnassus), her own quest
#     5628 Returning Home, Priestess Josetta (Goldshire, Elwynn Forest)
#     5629 Returning Home, Laurna Morninglight (Dolanaar, Teldrassil)
#     5630 Returning Home, Maxan Anvol (Kharanos, Dun Morogh)
#     5631 Returning Home, Brother Joshua (Cathedral of Light, Stormwind)
#     5632 Returning Home, Nara Meideros (the Park, Stormwind)
#     5633 Returning Home, Braenna Flintcrag (Hall of Mysteries, Ironforge)
#   Elune's Grace (level 20):
#     5672 Priestess Alathea (Darnassus), her own quest
#     5673 High Priestess Laurena (Cathedral of Light, Stormwind)
#     5674 Nara Meideros (the Park, Stormwind)
#     5675 High Priest Rohan (Hall of Mysteries, Ironforge)
# The guide sends you to the giver in the zone you stand in when it gets
# there (`when zone`; one per zone), else straight to Alathea; a letter you
# carry from anywhere is handed in on its own step (`when onquest`). Pickups
# are `talk` goals, not accepts: one guide accepting two quests of one
# exclusive set warns in lint, which does not follow `when`.
# Sources: quests.json and npcs.json for the givers (corrections: 5631
# Brother Joshua, 5633 Braenna Flintcrag, 5674 Nara Meideros); Forever's
# quest pages (snapshot) agree on every giver; Forever's Priest class quest
# list (data/local/quest-audit/): all unchanged; Starshards and Elune's
# Grace stay Night Elf spells (Elune's Grace reworked: half the chance to be
# hit by melee and ranged attacks for 15 sec or 3 misses).
# Nara Meideros stands in the Park, Stormwind's night elf quarter (npcs.json
# 35.7,63.2 on the live map, about 20.7,50.1 on the classic one).
# alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil carries Returning Home (5629) on the route;
# alliance/04-redridge-mountains and 06-ashenvale carry Elune's Grace 5673.
# Based on data, not play: written from the sources above.

step Starshards: Laurna Morninglight
  when zone "Teldrassil"
  when !onquest 5627,5628,5629,5630,5631,5632,5633
  zone Teldrassil
  tip At 10, Laurna Morninglight, the priest trainer in the building at the north edge of Dolanaar, hands you Returning Home, a letter for Priestess Alathea in Darnassus. Dolanaar is on the road west to Darnassus.
  level 10
  talk 3600                                   -- Laurna Morninglight: take Returning Home

step Starshards: Priestess Josetta
  when zone "Elwynn Forest"
  when !onquest 5627,5628,5629,5630,5631,5632,5633
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip At 10 in Elwynn Forest, Priestess Josetta, upstairs in the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire, hands you Returning Home, a letter for Priestess Alathea in Darnassus.
  level 10
  talk 377                                    -- Priestess Josetta: take Returning Home

step Starshards: Maxan Anvol
  when zone "Dun Morogh"
  when !onquest 5627,5628,5629,5630,5631,5632,5633
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip At 10 in Dun Morogh, Maxan Anvol, the priest trainer inside the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos, hands you Returning Home, a letter for Priestess Alathea in Darnassus.
  level 10
  talk 1226                                   -- Maxan Anvol: take Returning Home

step Starshards: Brother Joshua
  when zone "Stormwind City"
  when !onquest 5627,5628,5629,5630,5631,5632,5633
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 10 in Stormwind, Brother Joshua at the altar of the Cathedral of Light hands you Returning Home, a letter for Priestess Alathea in Darnassus. Nara Meideros in the Park has the same letter.
  level 10
  talk 5489                                   -- Brother Joshua: take Returning Home

step Starshards: Braenna Flintcrag
  when zone "Ironforge"
  when !onquest 5627,5628,5629,5630,5631,5632,5633
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 10 in Ironforge, Braenna Flintcrag in the Hall of Mysteries (Mystic Ward) hands you Returning Home, a letter for Priestess Alathea in Darnassus.
  level 10
  talk 5142                                   -- Braenna Flintcrag: take Returning Home

step Starshards: Priestess Alathea
  when !onquest 5627,5628,5629,5630,5631,5632,5633
  zone Darnassus
  tip At 10, go to Priestess Alathea on the upper balcony of the Temple of the Moon, at the south end of Darnassus: take the ramp up from the temple floor; she stands beside Tyrande Whisperwind. Stars of Elune is given and taken back at once and teaches Starshards. No letter needed. Forever made Starshards hit much harder, on a 30-second cooldown.
  level 10
  accept 5627                                 -- Priestess Alathea
  turnin 5627                                 -- Priestess Alathea: Starshards

step Starshards: Laurna's letter
  when onquest 5629
  zone Darnassus
  tip Take the road west from Dolanaar into Darnassus and go up to the upper balcony of the Temple of the Moon, beside Tyrande Whisperwind: Priestess Alathea takes Returning Home and teaches Starshards.
  turnin 5629                                 -- Priestess Alathea: Starshards

step Starshards: Josetta's letter
  when onquest 5628
  zone Darnassus
  tip Returning Home goes to Priestess Alathea, on the upper balcony of the Temple of the Moon in Darnassus, beside Tyrande Whisperwind: take the boat from Stormwind Harbor (or Menethil Harbor) to Auberdine, the boat on to Rut'theran Village, then the portal up into Darnassus.
  turnin 5628                                 -- Priestess Alathea: Starshards

