step Elune's Grace: Priestess Alathea
  when !onquest 5672,5673,5674,5675
  zone Darnassus
  tip At 20, Priestess Alathea on the upper balcony of the Temple of the Moon, beside Tyrande Whisperwind, teaches Elune's Grace with a quest she gives and takes back at once. In Forever, Elune's Grace halves the chance for melee and ranged attacks to hit you for 15 seconds or until three attacks miss.
  level 20
  accept 5672                                 -- Priestess Alathea
  turnin 5672                                 -- Priestess Alathea: Elune's Grace

